WEBVTT

00:03.640 --> 00:04.320
Two people

00:04.400 --> 00:05.120
Move this inside

00:05.200 --> 00:05.920
Carefully

00:06.000 --> 00:07.360
Please come in

00:07.440 --> 00:08.840
Hurry

00:13.880 --> 00:15.547
Why did we stop here?

00:19.160 --> 00:20.560
Careful, please come in

00:23.280 --> 00:24.880
Blocked outside, can't get through

00:25.400 --> 00:26.000
I'll clear a path

00:26.080 --> 00:27.240
No need

00:27.320 --> 00:28.720
Let's walk

00:30.560 --> 00:31.840
Prince of Ning

00:31.920 --> 00:32.840
General Zu

00:32.920 --> 00:34.320
Please come in

00:35.800 --> 00:37.160
Prince of Ning's meaning

00:37.280 --> 00:38.280
I understand

00:38.400 --> 00:39.520
If the general has difficulties

00:39.640 --> 00:41.280
In the capital or elsewhere

00:41.400 --> 00:43.000
You can directly send someone to inform me

00:43.160 --> 00:43.800
I will

00:43.880 --> 00:45.547
Do my utmost to help

00:45.760 --> 00:47.160
Thank you

00:48.400 --> 00:50.200
What a grand gesture

00:50.640 --> 00:51.960
Move faster

00:52.040 --> 00:54.373
Don't block others from coming and going

00:56.560 --> 00:58.040
Second brother is here too

00:58.120 --> 00:59.787
Greetings to Prince of Jin

01:00.880 --> 01:02.280
General Zu

01:02.680 --> 01:04.080
Elder brother

01:04.280 --> 01:05.040
Why

01:05.120 --> 01:06.787
Did you walk here yourself?

01:08.000 --> 01:09.480
I blocked the way ahead

01:09.560 --> 01:11.040
If you have anything to move

01:11.160 --> 01:12.160
I'll have them help you move it

01:12.320 --> 01:14.040
No need to trouble elder brother
